  "description": "Beautiful, wealthy, and smart, Yeori Cheon is a chaebol heiress cursed with the ability to see ghosts. In order to appease the restless spirits, she secretly helps them find their missing bodies. When she meets Gang-uk Ma, a prosecutor investigating unsolved murder cases, the two join forces to solve paranormal cases. As they confront increasingly dangerous cases, an unexpected romance begins to blossom.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
